Bot Tich Xanh
=============

Single-file Telegram bot stored in `bot.py`.
The bot checks Facebook page verification (tích xanh) using cookies
and supports quick check + auto watch (30–60s).

Features
--------
- Check nhanh (1 lần)
- Theo dõi tự động, báo khi có tích
- Quản lý user và cookie (admin)

Quick start
-----------
1) Set environment variables:
   export TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="YOUR_TOKEN"
   export BOT_ADMIN_IDS="123456789"

2) Install Selenium (required for browser automation):
   pip install selenium

3) Install ChromeDriver:
   - Download ChromeDriver that matches your Chrome version
   - Set CHROMEDRIVER_PATH to the driver path (optional if Selenium Manager works)

4) Run the bot:
   python bot.py

State file
----------
The bot stores state in: data/state.json
You can override it with:
   export BOT_STATE_PATH="/path/to/state.json"

Browser settings
----------------
- CHROMEDRIVER_PATH: path to chromedriver.exe
- SELENIUM_HEADLESS: set to 0 to show browser UI
